# libFuzzer dictionary for mquickjs's JS grammar (keywords, operators, and
# builtin/stdlib identifiers actually implemented by this reduced engine --
# see mqjs_stdlib.c). Single-line tokens only (see docs/netnew-worker-prompt.md
# SS6, "libFuzzer dictionary tokens must be single-line").
